#describe what Every release gets Lantern-mac-arm64.zip, a byte-identical copy of Lantern-mac.zip, so the updater can find the Apple silicon build.
#describe before Releases had Lantern-mac.zip and Lantern-win-x64.zip; darwin-arm64 answered 404.
#describe after Releases have three assets; Lantern-mac.zip stays the download link.
#describe verified typecheck, lint and pnpm test are green; the release workflow was not run.
~ .github/workflows/release.yml
