#order .github/workflows/release.yml
#order test/release-workflow.test.ts
#order README.md
#order docs/installation.md
#reason .github/workflows/release.yml The updater files a darwin zip as arm64 only when the name has -arm64, so Apple silicon got a 404.
#reason README.md Tells readers the Apple silicon build is also published as Lantern-mac-arm64.zip for the updater.
#reason docs/installation.md Keeps the release description true now that the publish job adds a third file.
#reason test/release-workflow.test.ts Guards that the copy exists, runs before the upload, and fails when the source is missing.
#story Apple silicon Macs find updates
#step actor A maintainer pushes a v* tag
#file .github/workflows/release.yml
#step action The release also publishes the Mac zip as Lantern-mac-arm64.zip
#file .github/workflows/release.yml
#file test/release-workflow.test.ts
#step subject The release page
#file README.md
#file docs/installation.md
#below interaction Apple silicon users are offered the update
#below consequence The update check answered not found => The update check finds the build
